ZTable :-

From Co.Code
Account Type (KOART)
GL for Co.Code
To.Co.Code
GL for To Co.Code
To Co.Code Cost Center
To Co.Code Profit Center
Business Area
OFFSET GL
T001-BUKRS
BSEG - KOART

SKB1-GL where Co.Code is FROM Co.Code

OR

KUNNR-LFB1
T001-BUKRS
SKB1-GL where Co.Code is FROM Co.Code

CSKS-KOSTL where CSKS-BUKRS =3D TO Co.Code
CEPC-PRCTR where CEPC-RBUKRS =3D TO Co.Code
BUPLA
SKB1 where BUKRS =3D TO CO.CODE

Selection Screen
FROM Co.Code - BUKRS
Period - Poper (1 Value only)
Year - RYEAR


Program logic :-

Step 1 - Get Document Numbers for the GL
Table ACDOCA

RLDNR - 0L (Hardcode)
RRCTY - 0
RBUKRS - Selection Screen
GJAHR - Selection Screen
POPER - Selection screen
RACCT - 95671 and 956712 (HardCode)

Execute
Get all BELNR


Step 2 - Get Sub-total for Accounts in those Documents
Table BSEG

BUKRS - Selection Screen
BELNR - from above
GJAHR - Selection Screen
HKONT - NE 95671 and 956712

Subtotal as below :-
Where KOART =3D K, subtotal at every LIFNR --> for DMBTR & DMBE2
Where KOART NE K, subtotal at every HKONT,  for DMBTR & DMBE2

Now, this amounts are to be posted in OVL against the mapped GL / CC / PC

Mapping Table - take BSEG KOART against ZTable for K, else take against BLA=
NK

Posting in OVL.


  1.  Get Last day of Posting period

Period in OVC and OVL are different. This must be converted.



Get last day of Period (selection Screen) from OVC.

This Last day, this must be the Document Date and Posting Date in OVL.





  1.  Get Mapped GL from the Custom Table.



  1.  Post the document for each GL against MAPPED GL / Vendor - Posting Ke=
y based on + or negative account (40 or 50). Add CC / PC / Business are fro=
m Custom Table.


  1.  Document Currency =3D DMBTR of OVC (COP), and LC2 =3D DMBE2 (USD) of =
OVC. INR will be converted.



  1.  Add a line for the opposite Posting Key to Off-set GL from the Table.


Regards,
Raju







